    {
        "content": "<p>I was looking up ZFSets and noticed the following API for PSets</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>mathlib psets code</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\">-- The type of pre-sets in universe `u`. A pre-set</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">family</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">sets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">indexed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"bp\">`.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZFC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">universe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defined</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">quotient</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">this</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ensure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">extensionality</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">pp_with_univ</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">use_set_notation_for_order</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- The underlying type of a pre-set -/</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">«</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">»</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- The underlying pre-set family of a pre-set -/</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Func</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x.Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mk_type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">«</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">»</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mk_func</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Func</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">eta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x.Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x.Func</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<p>and I wondered if all of it couldn't just be replaced with</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">pp_with_univ</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">use_set_notation_for_order</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">«</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">»</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Func</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">«</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">»</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PSet</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Is there a reason this isn't done?</p>",
